#: lib/potok_ide_web/controllers/page_html.ex:239
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Administrator, All members and roles you make yourself, with 20 permissions: from writing and sending files to creating events and editing the group. A sub-group takes over its parent's roles or has its own. A poll's decision can also give or take a role, a process can put that to the vote, and a group can elect its administrators instead of keeping its founders. You can also ask for a role, when you ask to join a group or as a member, and say why: each role says whether whoever manages requests gives it or a vote decides, and a group can let a vote decide who joins it too. Every member sees who may do what in the group, and why, also for one or more roles picked together; an admin can open the group as those roles would see it, and every change of roles stays on record for all the members."
msgstr "Administrator, Svi i uloge koje sam napraviš, sa 20 dozvola: od pisanja i slanja fajlova do pravljenja događaja i uređivanja grupe. Podgrupa preuzima uloge roditelja ili ima svoje. Ulogu može da dodeli ili oduzme i odluka glasanja, proces može to da stavi na glasanje, a grupa može da bira administratore umesto da ih zadrže osnivači. Ulogu možeš i da zatražiš, kad tražiš pristup grupi ili kao član, i da kažeš zašto: uz svaku ulogu piše da li je dodeljuje onaj ko upravlja zahtevima ili o njoj odlučuje glasanje, a grupa može i prijem u grupu da prepusti glasanju. Svaki član vidi ko šta sme u grupi i zašto, i za jednu ili više uloga zajedno, administrator može da otvori grupu onako kako je te uloge vide, a svaka promena uloga ostaje zapisana za sve članove."

